Package: @NAME@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libcurl4t64 | libcurl4, libgomp1, systemd
Recommends: docker.io, i2c-tools
Description: Xerxes Pi Admin Panel
 Web admin panel for the Xerxes Pi carrier board, served on port 8000.
 Includes llama-server for the Llama tab. Installs to /opt/xerxes and runs
 as the xerxes systemd service.
